# One leaf of a door or gate, placed at its hinge. The scene it is in already draws it: its
# line in scene.game names those instances, and it swings them about the hinge when someone
# near the doorway uses it. Both leaves of a doorway share a `middle`, so they open together.
name door
script door.star
property middle vec3 0 0 0      # the middle of the doorway
property reach float 5          # how near that, in metres, someone must be to use it
property swing float 90         # how far it opens, in degrees; the sign is which way
property slide vec3 0 0 0       # how far it moves aside as it opens, in metres
property seconds float 2.5      # how long opening takes
